                              "Start": 0,
                              "Length": 22,
                              "Type": "Bold"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "String": "Management of mannitol injection overdose is primarily symptomatic and supportive. This management involves discontinuing the infusion and addressing fluid and electrolyte imbalances. Dialysis partially removes mannitol. Repeated doses of mannitol lead to the build-up of mannitol even with dialysis.",
